ocan country ambientado entre inadaptados: Long Ryders, Jason & The Scorchers, Fetchin Bones, Lone Justice, Beat Farmers. El populismo de Los Lobos, Del Fuegos, Del-Lords y Walkabouts; en la Costa Oeste, los dementes Camper Van Beethoven, Donner Party, Catheads, Thin White Rope y los American Music Club de Mark Eitzel; en Texas, Wild Seeds, Poi Dog Pondering, Glass Eye; en los Grandes Lagos, BoDeans, Soul Asylum, Afghan Whigs, Shrimp Boat y los canadienses Cowboy Junkies. Nashville se renueva con los neotradicionalistas (George Strait, Randy Travis, Garth Brooks, Lyle Lovett, Steve Earle, Dwight Yoakam) y el surf instrumental vuelve con Shadowy Men On A Shadowy Planet.","color":"#f59e0b","family":"Raíces: rock'n'roll, country y roots","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#roots-80s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":51573063419914,"artist":"Dwight Yoakam","artist_id":185492973101549,"title":"If There Was a Way","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"Ln14ZuklyuY","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Roots-rock de los ochenta y cow-punk","scene_id":227407993671548,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#roots-80s","chapters":["Sección 5.17"],"pages":[[1,195,null]]},{"id":92434945508009,"artist":"Dwight Yoakam","artist_id":185492973101549,"title":"This Time","year":1993,"ess":0,"yt":"ICHnWFt6AXE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Roots-rock de los ochenta y cow-punk","scene_id":227407993671548,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#roots-80s","chapters":["Sección 5.17"],"pages":[[1,195,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":195,"text":"…scene with its loud and frantic sound that mixed rockabilly, honky-tonk and blues, and borrowed the emphasis from Bruce Springsteen's popul